provision of computer facilities it is highly desirable to budget in the original plans for
sufficient office staff to carry out the required work.In any event,it is important to provide
for sufficient to carry out the various editorial and initial office checking procedures. It might be found worthwhile to try to make ad hoc arrangements to get one or two skilled
people to oversee the forms as they come in,even if their services are dispensed with for the


